     "body": "<p>Thanks Kevin! I did some light editing and added a note referencing the memento spec (its a little redundant with the first paragraph of that document, but it seems appropriate to mention the memento datetime negotiation pattern used in the datetime negotiation section).</p>\n\n<p>Think we just need to link to the section then we're good to go.</p>",
